          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "The September work order is **WO-2025-09-004** (**MO-25-09-1070**), for Cooler Plate Pack. Its component-issue source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** was recorded for **$318,250.75** (31,825,075 cents).\n\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30 20:25:00  \n- **September period entered Pending Close:** 2025-09-30 18:00:00  \n- **Time after Pending Close:** 145 minutes  \n- **Recorded accounting status:** POSTED  \n\n**Conclusion:** The POSTED status is inconsistent with the supplied Oracle policy. This INPUT event was created after Pending Close; the policy says newly created transactions are not processed in that state, and this event type is not among the stated exceptions. The review was read-only. The report was submitted and verified.",
